rtk (Rust Token Killer)
https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk, tag v1.1.0
Copyright 2026 RTK AI Labs
- crates/shodh-rag/src/harness/compress/mod.rs follows the design of rtk's
  Apache-2.0 command filters (src/cmds/rust/cargo_cmd.rs,
  src/cmds/git/git_cmd.rs, src/cmds/python/pytest_cmd.rs,
  src/cmds/js/vitest_cmd.rs, src/cmds/go/go_cmd.rs, and the grep and find
  grouping of src/cmds/system/): one filter per program that drops success
  noise, and a never-worse guard. Modified: rewritten without regular
  expressions, and rtk's caps and truncation of failure output are left
  out, so failures are never shortened. rtk's compression engine (engine/,
  rtk-engine) is under the Business Source License 1.1, not Apache-2.0;
  none of it is used. rtk ships no NOTICE file.

